        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Distorted Perfection: The Classic Minesweeper Reimagined with Speed and Strategy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distorted Perfection</strong> revolutionizes the classic Minesweeper puzzle by injecting an innovative turn-based duel system and strategic skills, creating an entirely new dimension of competitive puzzle psychological warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the tedious solo puzzle. You are now thrust into a fierce world of psychological combat, where you and the opposing AI take turns vying to secure <strong>Hazard Zones</strong> on the field. Every choice you make in your turn provides information to your opponent, transforming a simple logic puzzle into a strategic battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Core Rules: Turn-Based Scoring Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duel Format:</strong> The player and the computer alternate turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Limit:</strong> Only <strong>one</strong> action (Identify Safe Zone or Seal Hazard Zone) can be performed per turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winning Condition:</strong> Score points by sealing Hazard Zones. The side with more points at the end of the game wins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Differentiated Strategic Depth: What Makes This Game Special?</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is No &quot;Safe&quot;: Information is a Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traditional Minesweeper focuses on 'safely opening tiles,' this game is different. The moment you confirm a Safe Zone, your opponent can use that information on their next turn to seal a Hazard Zone and steal the points. The game transcends simple tile-opening; you must utilize maximum logical deduction to anticipate your opponent's move and secure the Hazard Zone first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fast-Paced Turn System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a time limit per turn and quickly revealing tiles, the game maintains a high-speed flow. Experience a rapid turn-based duel that demands constant tension, prediction, and swift action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Campaign Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a shape that was distorted from birth</strong> and embark on your adventure. Progress through the game, acquire new skills to grow stronger, and face increasingly challenging enemies armed with their own unique skills to impede your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Game, Your Rules: Custom Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Custom Mode allows you to set all the rules exactly how you want them: board size, time limit per turn, AI difficulty, and even whether the player and computer can use their special skills.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Distorted Perfection: The Classic Minesweeper Reimagined with Speed and Strategy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distorted Perfection</strong> revolutionizes the classic Minesweeper puzzle by injecting an innovative turn-based duel system and strategic skills, creating an entirely new dimension of competitive puzzle psychological warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the tedious solo puzzle. You are now thrust into a fierce world of psychological combat, where you and the opposing AI take turns vying to secure <strong>Hazard Zones</strong> on the field. Every choice you make in your turn provides information to your opponent, transforming a simple logic puzzle into a strategic battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Core Rules: Turn-Based Scoring Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duel Format:</strong> The player and the computer alternate turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Limit:</strong> Only <strong>one</strong> action (Identify Safe Zone or Seal Hazard Zone) can be performed per turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winning Condition:</strong> Score points by sealing Hazard Zones. The side with more points at the end of the game wins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Differentiated Strategic Depth: What Makes This Game Special?</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is No &quot;Safe&quot;: Information is a Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traditional Minesweeper focuses on 'safely opening tiles,' this game is different. The moment you confirm a Safe Zone, your opponent can use that information on their next turn to seal a Hazard Zone and steal the points. The game transcends simple tile-opening; you must utilize maximum logical deduction to anticipate your opponent's move and secure the Hazard Zone first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fast-Paced Turn System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a time limit per turn and quickly revealing tiles, the game maintains a high-speed flow. Experience a rapid turn-based duel that demands constant tension, prediction, and swift action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Campaign Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a shape that was distorted from birth</strong> and embark on your adventure. Progress through the game, acquire new skills to grow stronger, and face increasingly challenging enemies armed with their own unique skills to impede your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Game, Your Rules: Custom Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Custom Mode allows you to set all the rules exactly how you want them: board size, time limit per turn, AI difficulty, and even whether the player and computer can use their special skills.</p>",
